---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="PikoBuy Spreadsheet FAQ | Finds, QC and Ordering" description="Answers about source-led PikoBuy finds, QC photos and ordering workflow.">
  <section class="page-intro article">
    <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h1>PikoBuy Spreadsheet FAQ</h1>
    <h2>Is this the official PikoBuy website?</h2><p>No. This is an independent research site. It points visitors to source data and to PikoBuy only when they choose to continue.</p>
    <h2>Where do product details and pictures come from?</h2><p>The intended source of truth is FindSpreadsheet. Product records must not be manually copied into this project.</p>
    <h2>What can QC photos tell me?</h2><p>They can help review the received item, its colour, visible condition and selected variant. They cannot guarantee authenticity, stock, future performance or customs treatment.</p>
    <h2>How do I order?</h2><p>Open the source item, confirm its options, then use the PikoBuy product route. Check the marketplace listing and agent checkout before paying.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
